    <item>
      <title>Orbit 2026.11.11.0540</title>
      <pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:40:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>202611110540</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2026.11.11.0540</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <sparkle:releaseNotesLink>https://github.com/siosphere/orbit-updates/releases/tag/v202611110540</sparkle:releaseNotesLink>
      <orbit:note>Chromium 156.0.8078.88.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Long tab titles on Mac now truncate with an ellipsis instead of flickering when hovered.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>You can now clear browsing data from the History menu, command bar, or Ctrl+Shift+Delete.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>You can now create a new tab while a split view is showing on Mac.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The sidebar now shows the selected page under a collapsed folder and scrolls it into view.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The extension store's install and remove buttons now say "Add to Orbit" and "Remove from Orbit.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Split pages in the sidebar now highlight on hover and show a button to close them.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Pinned tabs and favorites that have navigated away can now be updated to their current page.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>The back button now works while a page is still loading.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Right-click on Mac now shows Copy, Copy Image, Save Image As, and Copy Link.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>Unselected split rows in the sidebar no longer appear highlighted.</orbit:note>
      <orbit:note>…and 1 more change</orbit:note>
      <orbit:chromium>156.0.8078.88</orbit:chromium>
